## 6. Testing Strategy

### Unit Tests (`test/features/...`)
- `add_product_test.dart`: verify product creation & persistence mapping.
- `delete_product_test.dart`: verify soft/hard delete & sales independence.
- `checkout_sale_test.dart`: verify invoice counter increment & cart calculations.
- `get_sales_reports_test.dart`: verify date filtering (Today, This Month, All Time).

### Widget Tests (`test/shared_widgets/...`)
- `app_button_test.dart`: verify min touch target size (≥64dp) and tap callback.
- `product_stepper_card_test.dart`: verify increment & decrement button events.
- `app_numeric_keypad_test.dart`: verify key taps append/clear digits correctly.
